  "loc": "Abstract, p.1683; Sec. 3, p.1685",
  "quote": "a mechanism to find multi-user consensuses over these preferences",
  "note": "The main object is detecting unanimous consensus over users' appropriateness preferences and synthesising a minimal set of norms. It is set-cover optimisation in normative multi-agent systems. The paper never frames this as voting or as a voting rule, so it is outside scope under a strict reading. Coding stopped here."
